sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant Entry as Route Handler / Action
    participant Val as Validation
    participant Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant Drizzle
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant RT as Realtime
    participant Client as Client Refresh
    Browser->>MW: Request
    MW->>Entry: Allowed request
    Entry->>Val: Parse input
    Val->>Service: Typed command
    Service->>Repo: Domain operation
    Repo->>Drizzle: Query or transaction
    Drizzle->>DB: Execute
    DB-->>Drizzle: Commit result
    Drizzle-->>Repo: Typed rows
    Repo-->>Service: Domain result
    Service-->>Entry: Response model
    Service-->>RT: Publish when relevant
    Entry-->>Browser: Response
    RT-->>Client: Push update